990/extras/1fd62dc8918ade7da2933a4e6d82d976.poster.avif?t=1728030840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469990/extras/1fd62dc8918ade7da2933a4e6d82d976.webm?t=1728030840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469990/extras/1fd62dc8918ade7da2933a4e6d82d976.mp4?t=1728030840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The outcome of battle on the frontline is greatly influenced by what happens in the rear. This is where commanders can build a base system to upgrade and evolve their troops through appropriate utilization of resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469990/extras/e5a96dde684d51a94dacdae8a67a61fa.webp?t=1728030840\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469990/extras/90dd6b46a0b05e2aa4cb222ac667295d.avif?t=1728030840\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469990/extras/be8b63dfc11c57549380cfd34c57a1ef.avif?t=1728030840\" /></span>",
